{"name":"Kagarr","status":"ok","title":"Nagarr","pageId":124213,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nagarr</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9-10_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-10-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alt spelling\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alt. spelling</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Kagarra</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yacla (archaic)<sup id=\"cite_ref-SotM-54_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SotM-54-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The <a href=\"/wiki/Nagawater\" title=\"Nagawater\">Nagawater</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Serpents%27_Holding\" title=\"Serpents' Holding\">Serpents' Holding</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4,100<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Triad\" title=\"The Triad\">The Triad</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Torm\" title=\"Torm\">Torm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\">Ilmater</a>), <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra_(Midnight)\" title=\"Mystra (Midnight)\">Mystra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Wool, <a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">fish</a> (from the Nagawater), and (by <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>) trade<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mayor</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mayor</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Torgis Hatchetson (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVG9yZ2lzX0hhdGNoZXRzb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Torgis Hatchetson</span> (<a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Nagarr</b>, sometimes marked as <b>Kagarra</b> on maps,<sup id=\"cite_ref-websup_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-websup-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> also named <b>Yacla</b> around the 9th century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-SotM-54_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SotM-54-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> was a fortified village found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Vilhon_Reach\" title=\"Vilhon Reach\">Vilhon Reach</a> between <a href=\"/wiki/Sespech\" title=\"Sespech\">Sespech</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Lake_of_Steam\" title=\"Lake of Steam\">Lake of Steam</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9-10_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-10-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-SK-p133_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p133-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>, it was a protectorate of <a href=\"/wiki/Ankhapur\" title=\"Ankhapur\">Ankhapur</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Armed_forces\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armed forces</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Description_&_Layout\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description &amp; Layout</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notable_locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable locations</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Organizations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Organizations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Organized_Play_&_Licensed_Adventures\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The village sat on the southwest bank of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nagawater\" title=\"Nagawater\">Nagawater</a> upstream from where the <a href=\"/wiki/Nagaflow\" title=\"Nagaflow\">Nagaflow</a> began. It was on the fringes of the land between the Nagawater and the <a href=\"/wiki/Winterwood\" title=\"Winterwood\">Winterwood</a> called the <a href=\"/wiki/Serpents%27_Holding\" title=\"Serpents' Holding\">Serpents' Holding</a>. The <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ankh Road (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW5raF9Sb2FkP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Ankh Road</span> connected Nagarr with <a href=\"/wiki/Ankhapur\" title=\"Ankhapur\">Ankhapur</a> to the southwest, paved since 1370 DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9-10_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-10-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The mayor in 1370 DR was <span class=\"new\" title=\"Torgis Hatchetson (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVG9yZ2lzX0hhdGNoZXRzb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Torgis Hatchetson</span>. In reality, the true influences were the merchants along Nagarr's docks and <a href=\"/wiki/Janol_Famisso\" title=\"Janol Famisso\">Janol I</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nagarr was a simple farming-fishing village, but by 1370 DR with the rise of Janol I of Ankhapur, major reconstruction and increase in population as a trade transit point gradually expanded it to accommodate trade.\n</p><p>The most common stories were told in the inns and taverns of Nagarr all involved the monstrous and mysterious <a href=\"/wiki/Naga\" title=\"Naga\">naga</a>. The locals had no idea that separate species of good, evil and neutral naga all lived in the area (which <span class=\"new\" title=\"Orswin (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT3Jzd2luP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Orswin</span> failed to do with his attempts) and the consensus was the only good naga was a dead naga.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armed_forces\">Armed forces</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Armed forces\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Armed forces\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of 1370 DR, 375 members of Ankhpur's Watch were permanently loaned to the Mayor of Nagarr.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Description_.26_Layout\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description_&_Layout\">Description &amp; Layout</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description & Layout\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description & Layout\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_locations\">Notable locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Inns</dt>\n<dd></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"new\" title=\"Scaly Catfish (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2NhbHlfQ2F0ZmlzaD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Scaly Catfish</span> • <span class=\"new\" title=\"Naga's Water (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTmFnYSUyN3NfV2F0ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Naga's Water</span> (1370 DR-)</dd>\n<dt>Taverns</dt>\n<dd></dd>\n<dd>Scaly Catfish</dd>\n<dt>Temples</dt>\n<dd></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"new\" title=\"Palace of Justice, Duty, and Sufferance (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGFsYWNlX29mX0p1c3RpY2UsX0R1dHksX2FuZF9TdWZmZXJhbmNlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Palace of Justice, Duty, and Sufferance</span> (<a href=\"/wiki/The_Triad\" title=\"The Triad\">The Triad</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/Tyr\" title=\"Tyr\">Tyr</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Torm\" title=\"Torm\">Torm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\">Ilmater</a>) • <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Mysteries (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfTXlzdGVyaWVzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Mysteries</span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Mystra_(Midnight)\" title=\"Mystra (Midnight)\">Mystra</a>) • <span class=\"new\" title=\"Shrine to Dawn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2hyaW5lX3RvX0Rhd24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Shrine to Dawn</span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a>)</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Organizations\">Organizations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Organizations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Organizations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <span class=\"new\" title=\"Red Masks (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVkX01hc2tzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Red Masks</span> was a fledgling organization headed by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Rathan Silverknife (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmF0aGFuX1NpbHZlcmtuaWZlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Rathan Silverknife</span> who lost in a turf war in <a href=\"/wiki/Innarlith\" title=\"Innarlith\">Innarlith</a> and ran to hide in Nagarr in 1370 DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Alamandra Whitehair (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWxhbWFuZHJhX1doaXRlaGFpcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Alamandra Whitehair</span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">cleric</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra_(Midnight)\" title=\"Mystra (Midnight)\">Mystra</a> overseeing the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Mysteries (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfTXlzdGVyaWVzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Mysteries</span> in 1370 DR, who advocated the appreciation of the wonders and beauty of magic and not just its convenience.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Cadrin Velaclaok (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2FkcmluX1ZlbGFjbGFvaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cadrin Velaclaok</span>, a cleric of <a href=\"/wiki/Ilmater\" title=\"Ilmater\">Ilmater</a> running the small <a href=\"/wiki/The_Triad\" title=\"The Triad\">Triadic</a> temple <span class=\"new\" title=\"Palace of Justice, Duty, and Sufferance (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGFsYWNlX29mX0p1c3RpY2UsX0R1dHksX2FuZF9TdWZmZXJhbmNlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Palace of Justice, Duty, and Sufferance</span> in 1370 DR.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Cathel deFaux (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0aGVsX2RlRmF1eD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Cathel deFaux</span>, an elderly cleric of <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Lathander</a> presiding over the newly founded <span class=\"new\" title=\"Shrine to Dawn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2hyaW5lX3RvX0Rhd24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Shrine to Dawn</span> in 1370 DR, who arrived from outside Nagarr.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Jordan Ariadne (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSm9yZGFuX0FyaWFkbmU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Jordan Ariadne</span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Half-sea_elf\" title=\"Half-sea elf\">Half-sea elf</a> of the passing <a href=\"/wiki/Aquatic_elf\" title=\"Aquatic elf\">sea elf</a> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ariadne (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJpYWRuZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Ariadne</span>. He was a water <a href=\"/wiki/Elementalist\" title=\"Elementalist\">elementalist</a> disciple of a local non-evil <a href=\"/wiki/Naga\" title=\"Naga\">naga</a>. He lived on an anchored sailing vessel with an enclosed cabin and came out to help the farmers with irrigation.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Orswin (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT3Jzd2luP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Orswin</span>, a sage from the North who advocated the the search and study of all varieties of serpents, was drawn to Nagarr because of the naga.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotSS-p157_4-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotSS-p157-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Rathan Silverknife (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmF0aGFuX1NpbHZlcmtuaWZlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Rathan Silverknife</span>, the founder of the new local <span class=\"new\" title=\"Red Masks (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVkX01hc2tzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Red Masks</span> by 1370 DR.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span id=\"Organized_Play_.26_Licensed_Adventures\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Organized_Play_&_Licensed_Adventures\">Organized Play &amp; Licensed Adventures</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><span class=\"new\" title=\"A Hope and a Prayer (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQV9Ib3BlX2FuZF9hX1ByYXllcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">A Hope and a Prayer</span></i></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nagarr?veaction=edit&section=11\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SotM-54-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SotM-54_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SotM-54_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>&#160;(January 2000). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Secrets_of_the_Magister\" title=\"Secrets of the Magister\">Secrets of the Magister</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 54. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0786914302\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0786914302\">978-0786914302</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRA-p9-10-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9-10_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9-10_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9-10_2-2\">2.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karen_Wynn_Fonstad\" title=\"Karen Wynn Fonstad\">Karen Wynn Fonstad</a>&#160;(August 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Forgotten_Realms_Atlas\" title=\"The Forgotten Realms Atlas\">The Forgotten Realms Atlas</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</